## 3️⃣ Quick Reference: The 2 Modes in TweakLens

| Button | What it does | When to use it |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`▶️ Test & Click`** | Acts like a real phone/browser. Clicks, typing, and navigation work normally. | Testing your app, clicking tabs, typing in search bars. |
| **`✏️ Edit UI Tools`** | Turns on the visual box drawer, element stamper, and reorder tools. | Dragging boxes over widgets, adding buttons, changing colors. |

---

## 4️⃣ Exporting to AI (Claude / Cursor / Hermes / CLI)
1. In **Edit Mode**, drag boxes over widgets or stamp new components.
2. In the right sidebar, pick what to change (Color, Text, Reorder, Insert).
3. Click **`📋 Copy Batch Plan for AI`**.
4. Paste it straight into your AI prompt along with the file you want to edit!
